  "iSupport Cultural Adaptation",
  "Workshop Brings Together",
  "Dementia Care Experts and",
  "Communities Across Four",
  "Countries",
  "48 views | 02/10/2023",
  "On 2 October 2023, the National Ageing",
  "Research Institute hosted the iSupport Cultural",
  "Adaptation Workshop, bringing together",
  "dementia carers, healthcare professionals, and",
  "researchers from Australia, New Zealand,",
  "Indonesia, and Vietnam.",
  "Facilitated by leading experts in dementia",
  "research from Australia and internationally, the",
  "workshop provided an opportunity to",
  "collaboratively discuss the cultural adaptation",
  "of iSupport - the World Health Organization's",
  "online skills and training program for dementia",
  "carers (https://www.who.int/publications/i/",
  "item/9789241515863).",
  "A total of 26 participants contributed valuable",
  "insights and lived experiences to help ensure",
  "that iSupport is culturally appropriate,",
  "accessible, and relevant for diverse",
  "communities across the region. The workshop",
  "discussions highlighted the importance of",
  "culturally sensitive dementia support and the",
  "role of co-design in developing meaningful",
  "digital health solutions for carers.",
  "Overview",
